Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|marketplace.app.acceptance|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Marketplace|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given ProductMenu goto Site
		|portletName|Sites|
	When Site tear Down CP
	And BlogsEntry tear Down CP
	And BookmarksFolder tear Down CP
	And WikiPage tear Down CP
	And Page tear Down PG
	And DMFolder tear Down CP
	And DMDocument tear Down CP
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Test Page|
	And CalendarEvent tear Down
	Then Calendar tear Down

Scenario: Marketplace Smoke
Priority: 5
	Given Marketplace smoke